  "decision_reason": {
    "scope_correction": "The initial two-locus proposal was rejected as incomplete because the same Paper 24 unit contains a third live translation of the same German Idealbasis lexeme.",
    "finiteness": "German authority defines Idealbasis through a finite generating family and makes possession of such a basis equivalent to the finite-chain condition. Explicit конечный preserves that mathematical content.",
    "terminology": "Russian базис идеала is the unambiguous noun construction; идеальный базис is liable to be read as an ideal or perfect basis rather than a basis of an ideal."
  },
